Read ARCHITECTURE.md first. This repository stores reusable AI coding context
files and skills, not application code.

Keep guidance portable, focused, and consistent across AGENTS.md and
.github/copilot-instructions.md. Put Copilot skills in
.github/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md with name and description front matter.
Do not include secrets, personal information, or unapproved proprietary content.
Run `npm run lint:md` after editing Markdown.
